==Battleground==
*1 [[Skelecat (Enemy)|Skelecat]] (450%) spawns after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>.
*2 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 1.33~2 seconds<sup>40f~60f</sup>.
*10 [[Skelecat (Enemy)|Skelecats]] (450%) spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*10 [[Skelecat (Enemy)|Skelecats]] (450%) spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 0.33~2 seconds<sup>10f~60f</sup>.
*10 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 22.67 seconds<sup>680f</sup>, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
*13 [[Skelecat (Enemy)|Skelecats]] (450%) spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*13 [[Skelecat (Enemy)|Skelecats]] (500%) spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*13 [[Skelecat (Enemy)|Skelecats]] (550%) spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*13 [[Skelecat (Enemy)|Skelecats]] (600%) spawn after 186.67 seconds<sup>5,600f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Skelecat (Enemy)|Skelecats]] (600%) spawn after 266.67 seconds<sup>8,000f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Because of Skelecat's high damage per hit, using multiple cheap meatshields over strong meatshields is preferred. Since the stage constantly spawns crowds of Skelecats, you should use Area Attackers and/or Wavers like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] or [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]], as they are able to deliver high amounts of damage at a time and provide you with cash when they do so.

